Just to recheck the order of the checks; 

it appears that you put the assignment of `TerminationGracePeriodSeconds` before the `PodTerminationGracePeriodSecondsOverride`. I think this makes sense however, can you explain the logic why you move the `TerminationGracePeriodSeconds` before the `DeletionGracePeriodSeconds`?

Thank you.

